  "answer": "A driver approaching a bridge or length of narrow road must give way to any oncoming vehicle that is on or approaching the bridge or length of road when the driver reaches the sign.",
  "general_tip": "Remember to always give way to vehicles on the bridge or length of road when approaching a give way sign.",
  "evidence": [
    "A driver approaching a bridge or length of narrow road with a give way sign must give way to any oncoming vehicle that is on, or approaching, the bridge or length of road when the driver reaches the sign.",
    "70 Giving way at give way sign at bridge or length of narrow road"
  ],
  "sources": [
    "[doc2_s00_c5]",
    "[doc1_s28_c7]"
  ]
}

{
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": "If a driver is past a keep left sign, they must drive to the left of the sign (Doc 2).",
  "general_tip": "",
  "evidence": [
    "(1) A driver driving past a keep left sign must drive to the left of the sign. (Doc 2)",
    "(2) A driver driving past a keep right sign must drive to the right of the sign. (Doc 2)"
  ],
  "sources": [
    "[doc2_s00_c10]",
    "[doc2_s00_c10]"
  ]
}

{
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": "No, individuals are not allowed to ride wheeled recreational devices on roads at night. The rules state that a person must not travel in or on a wheeled recreational device on a road at night (Doc 2, [doc2_s06_c24]). However, there is an exception for crossing the road safely at night (Doc 2, [doc2_s06_c24](3)).",
  "general_tip": "Always prioritize safety when crossing roads at night, and ensure you are following the specific rules for pedestrian and wheeled recreational device usage.",
  "evidence": [
    "A person must not travel in or on a wheeled recreational device on a road at night (Doc 2, [doc2_s06_c24]).",
    "In subsections (1) and (2), a person may cross the road in or on a wheeled recreational device or wheeled toy if they cross the road by the shortest safe route and do not stay on the road longer than necessary to cross safely (Doc 2, [doc2_s06_c24](3A))."
  ],
  "sources": [
    "doc2_s06_c24"
  ]
}

